		<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
		<p>GridPermit respects user privacy. Our calculator is designed to function without collecting personally identifiable information (PII) such as full names, phone numbers, or residential street addresses.</p>
		<p><strong>Data Processing:</strong> ZIP code and monthly bill inputs entered into the calculator are processed locally in your browser session to estimate utility region models and ROI calculations.</p>
		<p><strong>US State Compliance:</strong> GridPermit complies with applicable US state privacy regulations, including CCPA/CPRA rights. Users may direct privacy inquiries to privacy@gridpermit.com.</p>
